-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

The licence above covers the parts of Gatefold written by Celestial Themes:

  index.html, about.html
  style.css, and its Sass sources
  assets/js/main.js
  assets/js/overlay.js
  assets/js/overlay-nav.js
  the documentation

It does NOT cover the third-party components bundled alongside them. Each of
those keeps its own licence, and each licence travels with the file it belongs
to.


