-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
DEMO CONTENT
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

The images in assets/images/demo/portfolio/ are placeholders. They are sized and
named so the layout works the moment you open index.html — swap them file for
file with your own work.

The photographs shown in the live demo are from Unsplash. They are NOT included
in this download, and nothing in this licence grants any right to them.
